  "_note": "Who is a dependant for s.127 and s.128: TY 2026-27, Income-tax Act, 2025 s.127(9)(b) — the spouse, children, parents, brothers and sisters \"dependant wholly or mainly\" on the individual (as DED-DISABLED-DEPENDANT's note quotes it); s.128 takes it \"as s.127(9)\" (s.128(5)(a), DED-SPECIFIED-DISEASE's note). Reached by the family member's dependant.relationship and dependant.wholly.or.mainly; a member it does not reach is refused for either section. TY 2025-26: the 1961 counterparts are the Explanations to s.80DD and s.80DDB, whose words are NOT quoted in the repo; this version carries the 2025 Act's list, as the engine applied it before W-156c, and a sourcing item reads the Explanations to confirm or correct it (W-156c C4a, D-348). Conditions only; provenance and introduction are DED-DISABLED-DEPENDANT's. Old regime only, as those rows.",
